# DO droplet → `.notes/do` sync

**Canon:** `.notes/do/state.md` (this repo). Setup: `.notes/do/setup.md`.  
**Ops scripts:** `.notes/do/scripts/` (`books/` · `tls/` · `nginx/` · `archive/` — see `scripts/README.md`).

Same-turn: any droplet/volume/service/SSH/firewall/script-layout change on `stellasis-personal-tools` (`152.42.203.20`) → refresh Recall · Shape · Inventory · Next in `state.md`. No secrets. Script moves → update `scripts/README.md`.
